封顶处理</font><div style=""><font style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Cascadia Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Cousine, &quot;Roboto Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: initial;">S_i = min</span><span class="token text string" style="color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Cascadia Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Cousine, &quot;Roboto Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: initial;">(P_i, 100)</span></font></div></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="1942" y="682" fill="rgb(0, 0, 0)" font-family="&quot;Helvetica&quot;" font-size="18px" text-anchor="middle">单维度封顶处理&#xa;S_i = min(P_i, 100)</text></switch></g></g></g></g></g></g><switch><g requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"/><a transform="translate(0,-5)" xlink:href="https://www.drawio.com/doc/faq/svg-export-text-problems" target="_blank"><text text-anchor="middle" font-size="10px" x="50%" y="100%">Text is not SVG - cannot display</text></a></switch></svg>